DLG 0
Hello young Cleaner. Please clean my gutters at the top of that ladder. They're all gunked up. I broke my back cleaning them before. Please do me this favour.
NAME old man dialogue

DLG 1
You finished cleaning up the gunk!{exit "4" 0 11 "fade_w"}
NAME FINAL GUNK dialog

DLG 2

NAME GUNK dialog

DLG 3
 {shk}{wvy}WOOOOOOOOOOSH{/wvy}{/shk}
NAME water flow

DLG 4
"""
{wvy}{shk}{clr 2}WOOOOOOOSH{/clr}{/shk}{/wvy}

Another day another gunk... A job well done. I'd better head back down to that old guy.{exit "5" 0 11 "wave"}
"""
NAME Water 1 dialog

DLG 5
Thank you young man. I could not have done this without you... Now kindly disappear. (toggleGravity){exit "7" 11 13}
NAME old man 2 dialog

DLG 7
Huh?
NAME exit narration 1

DLG 8
What?
NAME exit narration 2

DLG 9
How'd I end up here?...
NAME exit narration 3

DLG a
Huh... It seems there's gunk in the sewers too. I guess I'd better get cleaning so I can show that old man what for...
NAME GunktheFirst dialog

DLG b
This place is crazy...
NAME crazy gunk dialog

DLG c
Whoa, What?!
